// 4-bit bitwise AND: (a3 a2 a1 a0) AND (b3 b2 b1 b0) → (out3 out2 out1 out0).
// Four parallel single-bit ANDs.
input a0, a1, a2, a3, b0, b1, b2, b3
and bit0(a=a0, b=b0)
and bit1(a=a1, b=b1)
and bit2(a=a2, b=b2)
and bit3(a=a3, b=b3)
output out0(in=bit0.out)
output out1(in=bit1.out)
output out2(in=bit2.out)
output out3(in=bit3.out)
